  "body": "### Description\n\nI joined+left `#forgejo-chat:matrix.org` twice from my account `@pinkie:matrix.org`, then sent two messages from a remote account, `@val:e2e.zone`.\r\n\r\nThe second message appeared in Element, but not the first. After reloading the page, neither was visible. However, both messages are visible on https://view.matrix.org/room/!qjPHwFPdxhpLkXMkyP:matrix.org/ (event ids: `$Fr8Iuzs2L5c17B5jk-_Hrup1Jzq52_SZ9TqM000dvZM` and `$yJevqQixexqD7KlJrj8ObiRScOrfcfhzpGyY9cdgnpo`)\r\n\r\nI see Element queried `https://matrix-client.matrix.org/_matrix/client/r0/rooms/!qjPHwFPdxhpLkXMkyP%3Amatrix.org/initialSync?limit=20` twice, which returned everything up to my last `leave` event.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nUntested, but I assume:\r\n\r\n1. join+leave a room from Element (possibly twice)\r\n2. have someone send a message (possibly from another homeserver)\r\n3. check the message is indeed displayed\r\n4. reload Element\n\n### Homeserver\n\nmatrix.org\n\n### Synapse Version\n\n1.74.0 (b=matrix-org-hotfixes,5a1b56b9b0)\n\n### Installation Method\n\nI don't know\n\n### Database\n\npostgresql\n\n### Workers\n\nI don't know\n\n### Platform\n\nn/a\n\n### Configuration\n\n_No response_\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\nn/a\n```\n\n\n### Anything else that would be useful to know?\n\n_No response_",
